    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/online-education-classes/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Online Education Classes Theme is a modern and highly functional solution tailored for education-focused websites, online courses, virtual classrooms, e-learning platforms, tutoring centers, higher education institutions, training programs, universities, colleges, online coaching academies, skill development centers, and certification programs—while also supporting MOOC platforms, EdTech startups, language tutor marketplaces, corporate LMS providers, continuing education portals, teacher training institutes, exam preparation apps, virtual tutoring agencies, online certification portals, and skills development platforms—looking to build a dynamic learning environment. Whether you’re creating a portal for online learning, distance education, homeschooling, virtual training, or interactive classes, the theme provides essential tools for course creation, lesson planning, student assessments, and progress tracking through seamless integration with LearnPress, Tutor LMS, and Contact Form 7. Its clean layout, responsive design, and intuitive navigation support online quizzes, academic calendars, virtual labs, video lectures, Zoom-powered live classes, webinars, eBooks, discussion forums, downloadable study materials, and dedicated student dashboards. Additional features include customizable banners, teacher and student portals, schedule management, course enrollments, scholarship sections, and parent-teacher meeting tools—all optimized for speed, SEO, translations, and mobile responsiveness. Perfect for educators, tutors, training institutes, and e-learning businesses offering diverse learning programs, the Online Education Classes Theme delivers a professional, engaging, and interactive platform for providing high-quality education online."
    },
